  b:["Warm your hands for a minute, then measure again.","If your fingers turn white or blue in the cold, or stay numb, see a doctor."],rel:['fingerpos']},
 {id:'dizzy',q:"Why do I feel dizzy?",kw:['dizzy','dizziness','lightheaded','light headed','vertigo','spinning'],
