  b:["Sit or lie down, sip water and rise slowly.","Get urgent help if dizziness comes with chest pain, fainting, trouble speaking, weakness on one side or a severe headache.","See a doctor if it keeps happening."],rel:['tachy','water']},
 {id:'fatigue',q:"Why am I always tired?",kw:['tired','fatigue','exhausted','low energy','tiredness','sluggish','always tired'],
  p:["Tiredness has many causes: short or poor sleep, stress, dehydration, illness, low iron or thyroid problems."],
  b:["A high resting heart rate with low HRV for several days suggests your body is under strain.","Rest, hydrate and sleep well for a few days. See a doctor if it lasts more than two weeks."],rel:['sleep','hrvgood']},
 {id:'pregnancy',q:"Is my heart rate different in pregnancy?",kw:['pregnant','pregnancy','expecting','trimester'],
