 ["Treat everyone in the household at the same time with doctor-advised creams or shampoos.","Wash bedding and clothes in hot water and dry well."],['skin','fungal']);
E('wounds',"How do I care for a wound or boil?",['boil','abscess','infected wound','pus','wound not healing','cut infection','stitches','tetanus','tetanus shot','puncture wound','rusty nail','pimple boil'],
 ["Clean wounds with running water and cover them. Do not squeeze boils. Warm compresses can help them drain."],
 ["Redness spreading, fever, throbbing pain or pus mean see a doctor.","A tetanus booster is needed if you have a dirty wound and your last shot was over 5 to 10 years ago.","Diabetes slows healing, so be extra careful."],['firstaid','bleeding']);
E('nosebleed',"How do I stop a nosebleed?",['nosebleed','nose bleeding','bleeding from nose','epistaxis','blood from nose'],
