 ["A swollen face or fever with tooth pain needs urgent care.","Keep a knocked-out tooth in milk and see a dentist within the hour."],['dental','oralhealth']);
E('urinary',"What causes frequent urination?",['frequent urination','urinate often','night urination','nocturia','weak stream','prostate','enlarged prostate','bph','urine leakage','incontinence','overactive bladder','dribbling'],
