 ["Wash hands with soap for 20 seconds: palms, backs, between fingers and under nails. Do it before eating and cooking and after the toilet."],
 ["Sanitiser with at least 60% alcohol works when hands are not visibly dirty.","Keep nails short and clean."],['immunity','typhoid']);
E('foodsafety',"How do I avoid food poisoning?",['food safety','food poisoning prevention','stale food','leftover food','street food','raw chicken','food storage','expiry date','fridge','reheat','spoiled food','vomiting after eating'],
