 ["Eat leftovers within 2 to 3 days and reheat until steaming hot.","Be careful with street food during the monsoon.","Seek care for blood in stool, high fever or dehydration."],['diarrhea','typhoid']);
E('waterquality',"Is tap water safe to drink?",['tap water','boiled water','water purifier','ro water','safe drinking water','bottled water','water filter','hard water','drinking water quality','water borne disease'],
 ["Boiling for one minute makes water safe from germs. Filters and purifiers help if maintained."],
 ["Store water in clean, covered containers.","Clean your purifier as per its schedule."],['typhoid','diarrhea']);
E('petsafety',"Are pets safe for my health?",['pet allergy','dog health','cat scratch','pet hair','pet bite','bird flu','zoonotic','pets and kids','stray animals','dog licks'],
 ["Pets bring joy and activity, and most risks are small with hygiene and vaccines."],
 ["Wash hands after handling pets and keep their vaccines up to date.","Any bite or deep scratch needs washing and a doctor for rabies advice."],['bites','allergy']);
E('mosquito',"How do I prevent mosquito bites?",['mosquito','mosquito net','mosquito repellent safe','dengue prevention','malaria prevention','mosquito coil','insect bites','mosquito bite swelling','bedbug','sandfly','tick bite'],
