 ["Drink water often, avoid midday sun, wear light clothes and eat water-rich foods like cucumber, watermelon and curd."],
 ["Prickly heat improves with cool showers and loose cotton.","Dizziness, confusion or very hot dry skin is heatstroke: get help."],['heat','electrolytes']);
