 ["Dress in layers, keep moving indoors and get daylight. Moisturise skin and lips."],
 ["Joint stiffness and low mood are common in winter.","Keep up vaccines such as the flu shot."],['coldflu','skin']);
E('pollutionwinter',"What helps my breathing on smoggy days?",['smog breathing','air quality breathing','cough from pollution','steam inhalation','breathing exercises asthma','inhaler technique','nebulizer','peak flow'],
