 ["Steam inhalation can soothe the nose but take care with hot water.","Use asthma medicines as prescribed."],['pollution','asthma','pollutionmask']);
E('digitalhealth',"Is too much screen time harmful?",['screen time','too much screen','mobile addiction','gaming addiction','eye strain phone','neck from phone','kids screen time','screens before bed','video games','tv time'],
