 ["Take 20-20-20 breaks, keep screens out of the bedroom, and aim for outdoor time.","For children, limit screens and keep meals and bedtime screen-free."],['eyes','phone']);
E('loneliness',"How can I deal with loneliness?",['lonely','loneliness','no friends','feeling isolated','social isolation','miss people','homesick','new city lonely'],
