 ["Join a class, club or volunteer group, call one person daily and go outdoors.","If low mood persists, talk to a doctor or counsellor."],['lowmood','gratitude']);
E('grief',"How do I cope with grief?",['grief','bereavement','loss of loved one','death in family','mourning','coping with loss','someone died','sad after death'],
