 ["Sleep, food and gentle activity matter.","If you cannot function after several weeks, or think of harming yourself, seek professional help."],['lowmood','depression']);
E('selfesteem',"How do I build confidence?",['confidence','low self esteem','self worth','self doubt','body image','shy','inferiority','comparison','impostor'],
 ["Confidence grows with small wins, kind self-talk, good sleep and practising the thing you fear in small steps."],
 ["Limit social media comparison.","Therapy can help with long-standing self-doubt."],['nerves','gratitude']);
