 ["Calm the body first: slow breathing and a short break. Then talk using \"I feel\" statements."],
 ["Counselling can help couples and families.","If anyone is being hurt or threatened, contact local helplines or emergency services."],['anger','stressmgmt']);
E('studyhealth',"How can students stay healthy?",['student health','study sleep','exam diet','college diet','hostel food','all nighter','study breaks','memory tips','brain food','concentration tips'],
 ["Regular sleep, meals, movement and breaks improve learning more than long late nights."],
 ["Eat protein, fruit and nuts, drink water and limit energy drinks.","Review in short sessions and sleep after studying."],['exams','focus','sleep']);
