E('typhoiddiet',"What should I eat during typhoid or fever?",['typhoid diet','what to eat in typhoid','diet during fever','food during fever','fever diet','eat when sick','diet for jaundice','diet for dengue','food in dengue','papaya leaf','platelets increase food'],
