 ["Practise slow breathing together.","Limit screens and give choices, not pressure.","Seek help if worry is constant, if they avoid school, or you notice self-harm talk."],['childgrowth','studyhealth']);
E('stressmen',"How do I manage stress at work?",['work pressure','job stress','manager stress','overwork','too much work','deadline stress','workload','difficult boss','toxic workplace','saying no','say no','boundaries','work life balance tips'],
 ["Break big tasks into small ones, take a break every 60 to 90 minutes and protect your off-hours."],
 ["Say no or negotiate deadlines early.","Use a 2-minute breathing break before hard meetings.","Talk to your manager or HR if the workload is unreasonable, and to a doctor if you feel burned out."],['workstress','burnoutsigns']);
E('stressmoney',"How do I cope with money or life worries?",['money stress','financial stress','debt stress','job loss','unemployment stress','life problems','big changes','moving','uncertainty','future anxiety','exam result','loss of job','family problems'],
 ["Big worries feel smaller when broken into steps. Write down what you can control, pick one action for today and let go of the rest."],
 ["Talk to someone you trust and ask for help.","Keep sleep, food and movement steady, since they protect your coping ability.","If you feel hopeless, contact a doctor, counsellor or helpline."],['stresstools','lowmood']);
E('musicstress',"Does music or nature help with stress?",['music stress','calming music','listen to music','nature stress','nature sounds','forest','green exercise','gardening','pet therapy','petting dog','laughing','laughter','hobby stress','painting','singing'],
 ["Yes. Slow music, time in green spaces, gardening, laughter, singing and hobbies all lower stress and heart rate."],
 ["Try 10 to 20 minutes outdoors or a calming playlist at about 60 beats per minute.","Pick something you enjoy, not something you feel you should do."],['gratitude','sunlightmood']);
E('coldface',"Does cold water help calm me down?",['cold water face','splash cold water','dive reflex','ice pack face','cold shower stress','cool down anger','calm anger fast','anger breathing'],
